nd":199,"begin_anchor":"荀淑字季和潁川潁隂人","end_anchor":"專並有名稱時人謂八龍"},"commentary":[{"raw_quote":"(卿名况/趙人也)","body_offset":18,"raw_start":18,"raw_end":27,"excerpt_body_offset":18},{"raw_quote":"(為楚蘭陵令著書二十二篇號/荀卿子避宣帝諱故改曰孫也)","body_offset":18,"raw_start":29,"raw_end":56,"excerpt_body_offset":18},{"raw_quote":"(當塗縣名故/城在今宣州)","body_offset":55,"raw_start":123,"raw_end":136,"excerpt_body_offset":55},{"raw_quote":"(續漢/書曰)","body_offset":125,"raw_start":212,"raw_end":219,"excerpt_body_offset":125},{"raw_quote":"(淑對䇿刺梁/氏故出也)","body_offset":125,"raw_start":221,"raw_end":233,"excerpt_body_offset":125},{"raw_quote":"(禮記曰事師無犯無隠左右/就養無方服勤至死心喪三)","body_offset":172,"raw_start":284,"raw_end":309,"excerpt_body_offset":172},{"raw_quote":"(年/)","body_offset":172,"raw_start":337,"raw_end":341,"excerpt_body_offset":172},{"raw_quote":"(緄音昆燾音道汪音烏光反說文云/汪深廣也俗本改作注非專本或作)","body_offset":199,"raw_start":370,"raw_end":401,"excerpt_body_offset":199}],"page_markers":[{"raw_quote":"<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-1b>","body_offset":27,"raw_offset":67},{"raw_quote":"<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-2a>","body_offset":172,"raw_offset":311}]},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:yue-intro:p001","source_lines":[166,170],"raw_quote":"恱字仲豫儉之子也儉早卒恱年十二能說春秋家貧¶\n無書每之人間所見篇牘一覽多能誦記性沈静羙姿¶\n容尤好著述靈帝時閹官用權士多退身窮處恱乃託¶\n<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-10a>¶\n疾隠居時人莫之識從弟彧特稱敬焉初辟鎮東將軍¶\n","raw_quote_sha256":"d03913956ac729e11ec7392af76ae270a2055a7416ca9b03d6f9a262b649046b","body_before_excerpt_selection":"恱字仲豫儉之子也儉早卒恱年十二能說春秋家貧無書每之人間所見篇牘一覽多能誦記性沈静羙姿容尤好著述靈帝時閹官用權士多退身窮處恱乃託疾隠居時人莫之識從弟彧特稱敬焉初辟鎮東將軍","body_selection":{"start":0,"end":78,"begin_anchor":"恱字仲豫儉之子也儉早","end_anchor":"莫之識從弟彧特稱敬焉"},"commentary":[],"page_markers":[{"raw_quote":"<pb:KR2a0009_WYG_092-10a>","body_offset":63,"raw_offset":69}]},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-062-xunhan-zhongchen:shuang-intro:p001","source_lines":[39,40],"raw_quote":"爽字慈明一名諝(音息/汝反)幼而好學年十二能通春秋論¶\n語太尉杜喬見而稱之曰可為人師爽遂耽思經書慶¶\n","raw_quote_sha256":"c34ff57d97f368f452ed948bc4b27c64e7159eda09ffb300b9b8aa965e5c71dc","body_be